WEBVTT

00:00:01.250 --> 00:00:03.410
I want you to help me with something.

00:00:03.870 --> 00:00:04.790
Huh?

00:00:05.080 --> 00:00:06.950
I want you to help me avenge my dad.

00:00:08.410 --> 00:00:10.410
You're not playing against me.

00:00:11.250 --> 00:00:13.040
What do you mean?

00:00:13.410 --> 00:00:15.700
You told me to duel this guy, didn't you?

00:00:15.700 --> 00:00:17.500
To avenge your father?

00:00:17.500 --> 00:00:19.700
Oh, that? I made it all up.

00:00:21.160 --> 00:00:23.750
Why'd you trick me...?

00:00:24.950 --> 00:00:28.200
Because it'd be more fun, I guess.

00:00:38.080 --> 00:00:39.540
My name is Ryuuou.

00:00:39.540 --> 00:00:41.790
Starting today, you are my slave.

00:00:42.040 --> 00:00:43.200
Slave?

00:00:46.250 --> 00:00:47.910
It's only natural you'd be confused.

00:00:48.410 --> 00:00:52.160
Everything you thought you knew is being rewritten.
It's a real shock.

00:00:53.950 --> 00:00:56.330
We'll explain things to you
once you've had a chance to calm down.

00:00:56.330 --> 00:00:58.040
For now, please get in the car.

00:01:01.580 --> 00:01:02.500
Zero...

00:01:03.910 --> 00:01:05.580
Hey, what's wrong?

00:01:05.580 --> 00:01:08.330
M-my head...

00:01:08.660 --> 00:01:10.080
Can you stand up? Hey!

00:01:10.620 --> 00:01:12.830
Zero, obey Chuo's orders.

00:01:14.000 --> 00:01:15.000
Don't...

00:01:15.580 --> 00:01:19.370
Don't tell me what to do!

00:01:22.200 --> 00:01:32.500
I want a heart that can laugh without lying

00:01:37.950 --> 00:01:44.200
If I hadn't wanted anything from the start

00:01:45.500 --> 00:01:51.910
Maybe my heart wouldn't have sank so low

00:01:52.660 --> 00:02:00.790
I know the joy of being loved

00:02:00.790 --> 00:02:09.370
But it's not enough, it won't fill me up, it won't purge my fears

00:02:11.330 --> 00:02:15.330
Won't you wet my bone-dry heart?

00:02:15.330 --> 00:02:19.120
Pour the oil over it till it's overflowing

00:02:19.120 --> 00:02:24.660
My scream echoes out in vain

00:02:26.950 --> 00:02:30.910
I want to feel that this boring everyday life

00:02:30.910 --> 00:02:34.580
Is a blessing bestowed upon me

00:02:34.580 --> 00:02:47.040
I want a heart that can laugh without lying

00:02:54.700 --> 00:02:59.750
- bewilderment-

00:02:54.700 --> 00:02:57.830
Ryuuou, has that ever happened before?

00:02:58.080 --> 00:02:59.750
No, never.

00:03:00.330 --> 00:03:04.830
No slave wearing an SCM has ever disobeyed an order.

00:03:05.290 --> 00:03:08.450
Looks like that's just what happened.

00:03:10.660 --> 00:03:11.870
Where am...

00:03:12.160 --> 00:03:14.330
Good morning, Zero Shinagawa.

00:03:14.700 --> 00:03:17.870
Sorry to get right to it,
but we have a few questions for you.

00:03:18.750 --> 00:03:21.450
How were you able to defy your orders?

00:03:22.160 --> 00:03:23.660
Orders?

00:03:24.750 --> 00:03:26.080
I don't know.

00:03:27.120 --> 00:03:29.750
Don't tell me what to do!

00:03:33.250 --> 00:03:34.250
Zero...

00:03:35.620 --> 00:03:37.370
Run, Zero...

00:03:55.250 --> 00:03:59.450
There was a voice in my head... telling me to run...

00:03:59.450 --> 00:04:02.580
C'mon, now, don't tell me
you think you heard the voice of God.

00:04:03.540 --> 00:04:09.450
Interesting... perhaps an adverse reaction
to the SCM's control occurred as a form of self-defense?

00:04:09.750 --> 00:04:12.160
And that's the voice he heard?

00:04:12.580 --> 00:04:15.580
Looks like he's playing along
and following orders now, though.

00:04:15.580 --> 00:04:21.160
Perhaps when one has only just become a slave,
the SCM is not completely in control of them.

00:04:21.160 --> 00:04:22.450
I see...

00:04:22.910 --> 00:04:24.580
We'll have to be careful from here on out.

00:04:25.580 --> 00:04:27.000
By the way, Zero.

00:04:27.660 --> 00:04:29.910
How much money do you have saved up?

00:04:30.080 --> 00:04:32.370
S-saved up?

00:04:32.370 --> 00:04:37.370
Umm, around 2 million yen, I think...

00:04:37.660 --> 00:04:39.040
I see.

00:04:40.750 --> 00:04:42.370
I still don't have enough.

00:04:42.750 --> 00:04:44.410
I need to get more...

00:04:44.750 --> 00:04:46.330
More slaves...

00:04:49.790 --> 00:04:50.870
Master Ryuuou?

00:04:51.790 --> 00:04:53.040
What is it?

00:04:55.330 --> 00:04:58.120
Zenichi Bunkyo disappeared from his hospital room.

00:04:58.500 --> 00:04:59.250
What?

00:04:59.620 --> 00:05:02.250
And this was left in his stead.

00:05:08.040 --> 00:05:08.750
Look.

00:05:09.910 --> 00:05:15.450
I'M A CRAZY PERSON.

00:05:13.410 --> 00:05:15.450
A crazy person...?

00:05:15.750 --> 00:05:17.370
Seems to be the case.

00:05:17.950 --> 00:05:21.700
I'M A CRAZY PERSON.
I AM MADLY IN LOVE

00:05:17.960 --> 00:05:21.700
WITH A HOPELESS MAN.
I WROTE THIS LETTER TO YOU
TO ASK YOU A FAVOR.

00:05:18.080 --> 00:05:21.700
Must've left this letter behind after taking Zenichi.

00:05:21.700 --> 00:05:25.200
I HAVE THREE SLAVES.
I WANT TO STAKE EVERYTHING I HAVE

00:05:21.710 --> 00:05:25.200
ON AN SCM DUEL WITH YOU.
BECAUSE I'M SO CRAZY,
I DON'T CARE IF WE PLAY A GAME
WHERE I KNOW I'LL LOSE.

00:05:22.910 --> 00:05:25.200
It says he wants us to stake everything on a duel...

00:05:25.660 --> 00:05:29.580
Those are the terms, apparently.
What should we do, Ryuuou?

00:05:32.330 --> 00:05:36.080
He stole my slave, didn't he?

00:05:36.790 --> 00:05:39.540
I'll have to punish him appropriately for that.

00:05:47.870 --> 00:05:48.870
Chuo-san?

00:05:51.950 --> 00:05:54.250
Could I talk to you for a sec?

00:05:55.950 --> 00:05:57.000
Sure.

00:05:57.290 --> 00:06:01.250
Ataru
Chuo

00:06:03.750 --> 00:06:08.750
Her name is Shiori Adachi. I made her my slave.

00:06:08.750 --> 00:06:13.290
Sorry to tag along without asking.
Were you headed somewhere?

00:06:13.540 --> 00:06:17.370
Yeah, I was gonna go check out
the hospital Zenichi was at.

00:06:17.910 --> 00:06:23.290
First the knucklehead was slave to a dog,
now he's a slave to some "crazy person".

00:06:23.290 --> 00:06:25.910
What next, a tentacled space alien?

00:06:26.790 --> 00:06:30.080
Christ, I'm gonna need more cigarettes.

00:06:32.540 --> 00:06:35.910
Chuo-san, how did you become Ryuuou's slave?

00:06:38.410 --> 00:06:40.290
I lost a duel to Julia.

00:06:40.290 --> 00:06:42.750
No way! What the hell happened?

00:06:44.290 --> 00:06:47.540
KABUKI-CHO ICHIBAN-MACHI

00:06:44.870 --> 00:06:48.580
I used to work for a small company.

00:06:49.040 --> 00:06:53.790
Part of that job involved entertaining clients,
sometimes taking them out to girlie clubs.

00:06:54.910 --> 00:06:57.700
Nice to meet you. I'm Julia.

00:07:03.410 --> 00:07:07.040
Sorry... you just look like someone I used to know.

00:07:07.450 --> 00:07:09.830
What, did she look just like the first woman
you fell in love with?

00:07:13.040 --> 00:07:17.080
I started asking for Julia every time I went to that club.

00:07:17.580 --> 00:07:20.160
Then one day, Julia suddenly up and quit.

00:07:21.160 --> 00:07:23.660
I didn't think I'd ever see her again.

00:07:24.330 --> 00:07:26.830
But then, after a while, she reached out to me.

00:07:26.950 --> 00:07:29.910
She said she was working at a different club
and wanted me to come see her.

00:07:30.040 --> 00:07:32.450
Sorry to make you worry.

00:07:32.910 --> 00:07:37.370
It was the first time I'd seen her in a while,
and I instantly noticed she looked gaunt and worried.

00:07:40.620 --> 00:07:42.620
Hey, wanna play a game?

00:07:42.620 --> 00:07:43.750
A game?

00:07:43.750 --> 00:07:47.250
If you lose a game, it gives you a little electric shock.

00:07:47.250 --> 00:07:49.160
It's all the rage.

00:07:49.160 --> 00:07:51.660
Sure, I'll give it a try.

00:07:51.910 --> 00:07:54.330
It was an SCM, right?

00:07:54.330 --> 00:07:55.370
Yeah.

00:07:55.370 --> 00:07:59.700
She looked really down,
so I figured I'd play along with her.

00:07:59.910 --> 00:08:03.700
After I put in the SCM, I lost to her right away.

00:08:04.000 --> 00:08:05.910
What kind of game did you play?

00:08:06.750 --> 00:08:09.910
A kind of... color-guessing game.

00:08:09.910 --> 00:08:13.290
We can play any game we want,

00:08:13.290 --> 00:08:14.410
but I've got an idea...

00:08:15.370 --> 00:08:17.910
Why don't you try guessing
what color panties I'm wearing?

00:08:19.660 --> 00:08:21.700
What color were they?

00:08:22.290 --> 00:08:23.500
None...

00:08:23.500 --> 00:08:24.160
What?

00:08:24.620 --> 00:08:26.500
She wasn't wearing any.

00:08:26.500 --> 00:08:27.660
She was going commando.

00:08:28.750 --> 00:08:30.450
Wait, are you serious?!

00:08:31.620 --> 00:08:34.120
Still, somehow, that makes me feel better.

00:08:35.500 --> 00:08:39.700
You seemed like such a cool,
collected businessman, Chuo-san.

00:08:39.700 --> 00:08:41.950
But you're really just a normal guy.

00:08:42.910 --> 00:08:44.660
Was that what you wanted to talk about?

00:08:44.790 --> 00:08:46.330
No, that wasn't it.

00:08:47.330 --> 00:08:49.500
I just hadn't thanked you yet.

00:08:51.830 --> 00:08:58.450
Thank you very much for saving me
and Nakano-chan from Zenichi.

00:08:58.910 --> 00:09:01.540
The dog's the one who took him out.

00:09:01.540 --> 00:09:05.450
Plus I made you into Ryuuou's slaves.

00:09:05.790 --> 00:09:08.950
But you helped Nakano-chan, didn't you?

00:09:08.950 --> 00:09:11.910
I've got to at least thank you for that.

00:09:12.750 --> 00:09:16.450
Besides, this is a hundred times better
than being Zenichi's slave.

00:09:17.830 --> 00:09:21.700
Chuo-san, how do you get released from being a slave?

00:09:22.040 --> 00:09:23.870
You shouldn't think about that.

00:09:24.750 --> 00:09:27.580
I've thought about it a million times.

00:09:28.160 --> 00:09:33.500
The moment you think of going against your master,
you're overwhelmed by a feeling of terror.

00:09:33.910 --> 00:09:37.620
Then you eventually stop thinking about it altogether.

00:09:38.250 --> 00:09:40.870
I'll do the job he gives me,

00:09:41.000 --> 00:09:44.830
even if it means getting ordered to get more slaves.

00:09:46.000 --> 00:09:48.040
That's all we can do.

00:09:50.250 --> 00:09:52.080
Let me tell you something.

00:09:52.080 --> 00:09:54.540
You can't trust anybody involved in this.

00:09:55.330 --> 00:09:59.040
It doesn't matter if the people in this SCM game
are "good guys" or "bad guys".

00:09:59.160 --> 00:10:03.540
The important thing is whether
to distrust someone a little, or a lot.

00:10:04.370 --> 00:10:06.000
So don't trust me.

00:10:07.540 --> 00:10:09.330
I don't get it.

00:10:17.450 --> 00:10:18.750
Sorry to make you wait.

00:10:21.450 --> 00:10:23.750
Huh? Ayaka-san, have you lost weight?

00:10:24.330 --> 00:10:26.290
Yeah... maybe.

00:10:26.290 --> 00:10:29.410
Let's get right to it.

00:10:30.870 --> 00:10:34.000
Yesterday, this letter arrived in Ayaka's mailbox.

00:10:35.910 --> 00:10:37.910
A crazy person?

00:10:38.120 --> 00:10:39.250
What the hell?

00:10:39.250 --> 00:10:41.790
I'M A CRAZY PERSON.
I AM MADLY IN LOVE WITH A HOPELESS MAN.
I WROTE THIS LETTER TO YOU TO ASK YOU A FAVOR...
I HAVE THREE SLAVES.
I WANT TO STAKE EVERYTHING I HAVE ON AN SCM DUEL WITH YOU.
BECAUSE I'M SO CRAZY,
I DON'T CARE IF WE PLAY A GAME WHERE I KNOW I'LL LOSE.

00:10:40.080 --> 00:10:44.580
From the contents of the letter, it's safe to assume
it's a challenge from another SCM user.

00:10:45.200 --> 00:10:47.290
Is this really blood?

00:10:49.200 --> 00:10:51.870
And that might be perfume. Is the writer a girl?

00:10:52.040 --> 00:10:53.870
You're a regular Sherlock Holmes, Eia.

00:10:54.120 --> 00:10:59.500
If our mystery writer is Ryuuou,
then does that mean Ryuuou's a woman?

00:10:59.500 --> 00:11:01.250
I don't think that's the case.

00:11:01.580 --> 00:11:03.700
Seiya called me this morning.

00:11:04.080 --> 00:11:07.000
He asked if I was the one who sent the letter.

00:11:07.370 --> 00:11:10.580
So Ryuuou got the same letter, too...

00:11:11.330 --> 00:11:17.580
Yeah. There's a third party in the mix now,
going after both me and Ryuuou.

00:11:18.450 --> 00:11:21.660
Ayaka and I think we'll take on the challenge.

00:11:22.000 --> 00:11:24.540
You'll help us too, of course, right, Eia?

00:11:25.620 --> 00:11:27.200
Stop treating this like a joke.

00:11:27.620 --> 00:11:30.950
Come on, it's signed "from a crazy person".

00:11:31.250 --> 00:11:35.040
Isn't that fascinating?
Aren't you curious as to what they're like?

00:11:35.700 --> 00:11:37.080
How do you feel, Ayaka-san?

00:11:38.410 --> 00:11:42.200
Do you want to duel,
or do you really not want to do it at all?

00:11:42.790 --> 00:11:44.040
Uhh...

00:11:46.580 --> 00:11:49.660
I... want to do it.

00:11:51.910 --> 00:11:54.120
You need to stop this, right now.

00:11:54.620 --> 00:11:55.700
Stop what?

00:11:56.450 --> 00:11:57.830
Stop this SCM shit!

00:11:57.830 --> 00:12:01.370
Quit playing this game already
and let Ayaka-san go free!

00:12:02.910 --> 00:12:04.120
Hey, Eia?

00:12:04.750 --> 00:12:07.040
How many SCMs do you think are out there?

00:12:08.950 --> 00:12:12.120
Ryuuou already has five or more slaves.

00:12:12.450 --> 00:12:16.620
And this "crazy person" supposedly has got three.

00:12:17.250 --> 00:12:19.410
But all I've got is Ayaka.

00:12:19.580 --> 00:12:23.540
So what? You want to get more, then?

00:12:23.700 --> 00:12:25.620
What happened to not being interested in getting slaves?

00:12:25.620 --> 00:12:27.160
Was that all a lie?

00:12:27.160 --> 00:12:30.540
I told you before, I want to test myself.

00:12:31.250 --> 00:12:34.410
I want to bring myself to the brink in the SCM world...

00:12:34.620 --> 00:12:37.160
That's what I wanted, right?

00:12:37.910 --> 00:12:40.040
I thought you felt the same way.

00:12:41.160 --> 00:12:42.160
I might've once.

00:12:42.660 --> 00:12:44.160
But not anymore.

00:12:45.370 --> 00:12:47.910
This SCM stuff has gone off the rails.

00:12:47.910 --> 00:12:50.830
If you get too deep into the game,
you're going to end up losing.

00:12:50.830 --> 00:12:53.410
Now you're dragging in innocent people
and forcing them to do as you say...

00:12:53.620 --> 00:12:55.200
It's time to stop, okay?

00:12:57.000 --> 00:13:00.500
Why? Why don't you get it?!

00:13:01.790 --> 00:13:03.410
I thought you were on my side, Eia!

00:13:06.250 --> 00:13:09.250
You've changed.

00:13:13.620 --> 00:13:18.040
I won't help you get any more slaves.

00:13:31.370 --> 00:13:34.750
What are SCMs even supposed to be, Zushi?

00:13:35.120 --> 00:13:39.790
You duel people, make them your slaves,
get made a slave...

00:13:40.330 --> 00:13:43.910
And then what? Stay that way forever?

00:13:45.160 --> 00:13:46.330
But why?

00:13:49.330 --> 00:13:53.790
Let's give this back, along with the money he gave me.

00:13:59.040 --> 00:13:59.450
Come with your dog to
Shiopark Hotel #2315 at 9 PM tonight.
Crazy Person

00:14:02.330 --> 00:14:03.620
That idiot!

00:14:05.700 --> 00:14:10.830
Yuuga says he lost to that crazy person.

00:14:24.330 --> 00:14:26.750
Come with your dog to
Shiopark Hotel #2315 at 9 PM tonight.
Crazy Person

00:14:51.410 --> 00:14:52.950
Welcome.

00:14:55.200 --> 00:14:58.620
I am the crazy person.

00:15:05.330 --> 00:15:07.950
What the hell are you doing?

00:15:07.950 --> 00:15:09.950
That obvious?

00:15:14.120 --> 00:15:16.950
I'll get straight to the point, Eia.

00:15:18.080 --> 00:15:19.700
Lose a game to me.

00:15:19.790 --> 00:15:21.950
What? Look, I've had about enough of your screwing-

00:15:21.950 --> 00:15:23.200
I'm serious.

00:15:27.580 --> 00:15:29.160
Ayaka's in there.

00:15:29.160 --> 00:15:33.950
She's obediently following my orders.

00:15:34.660 --> 00:15:35.950
What the fuck did you do?!

00:15:38.910 --> 00:15:40.040
Ice?!

00:15:41.000 --> 00:15:42.790
Ayaka-san, what the hell are you doing?!

00:15:48.200 --> 00:15:49.500
Open the door!

00:15:49.500 --> 00:15:54.750
No! I'm his slave, I have to follow his orders!

00:15:56.120 --> 00:15:57.410
She's right.

00:15:58.660 --> 00:16:02.500
The door will only open
if Ayaka opens it from the inside.

00:16:02.750 --> 00:16:06.000
You're making her do this, though!
Let her open it already!

00:16:06.000 --> 00:16:07.580
This is torture!

00:16:07.950 --> 00:16:10.450
Well then, will you do as I say?

00:16:14.910 --> 00:16:17.870
Why won't you do what I ask you to?

00:16:17.870 --> 00:16:19.950
You just have to shut up and watch.

00:16:20.290 --> 00:16:22.160
Why are you so against that?

00:16:23.410 --> 00:16:25.370
School was so boring.

00:16:26.080 --> 00:16:30.660
All the girls I dated were boring, and fuck working.

00:16:31.040 --> 00:16:34.040
In the end, nothing could make me feel fulfilled.

00:16:34.660 --> 00:16:36.660
But the SCM's different!

00:16:37.000 --> 00:16:40.040
It's made me feel more alive than anything has before!

00:16:40.450 --> 00:16:43.910
We could do incredible things if we wanted, Eia!

00:16:44.080 --> 00:16:46.080
We've finally found where we belong!

00:16:46.500 --> 00:16:48.700
That's how I felt at first.

00:16:49.160 --> 00:16:52.040
But this SCM business is just wrong.

00:16:52.910 --> 00:16:55.040
I thought you'd say that.

00:16:55.290 --> 00:16:57.450
That's why I thought up this plan...

00:16:57.700 --> 00:17:00.580
To force you to stay by my side.

00:17:00.790 --> 00:17:04.580
What, you were going to take Ayaka-san hostage
and make me your slave?

00:17:04.830 --> 00:17:09.330
No. Then you wouldn't be my insurance anymore.

00:17:09.500 --> 00:17:12.500
There's no point to it all if you start wearing an SCM.

00:17:12.790 --> 00:17:14.580
What I want to do...

00:17:14.750 --> 00:17:17.040
...is make Zushiohmaru my slave.

00:17:18.120 --> 00:17:22.330
If I can do that, then you'll never leave me.

00:17:23.450 --> 00:17:24.790
You fucking coward.

00:17:26.120 --> 00:17:29.330
It's the best way to get you to stay with me.

00:17:29.330 --> 00:17:31.500
I won't let you start a duel with Zushi!

00:17:31.750 --> 00:17:33.410
Are you sure about that?

00:17:33.410 --> 00:17:37.790
I think Zushiohmaru wants to fight to protect his master.

00:17:38.580 --> 00:17:39.540
Isn't that right?

00:17:44.660 --> 00:17:47.410
Zushiohmaru and Ayaka will duel.

00:17:48.870 --> 00:17:51.040
Ayaka, challenge him to a duel!

00:17:51.540 --> 00:17:53.290
The duel will be an eating contest!

00:17:55.790 --> 00:17:57.200
The duel starts now!

00:17:59.660 --> 00:18:02.330
An eating contest? But there's nothing here to eat.

00:18:03.410 --> 00:18:06.910
No, it's right there on their plates.

00:18:24.330 --> 00:18:31.200
Better hurry up and get Zushiohmaru to eat, Eia,
or he'll become my slave.

00:18:31.660 --> 00:18:32.620
You bastard...

00:18:35.330 --> 00:18:36.450
Zushi!

00:18:37.290 --> 00:18:40.500
Do you want me to tear it up for you...?

00:18:49.580 --> 00:18:53.750
I can't! I can't do this to him!

00:18:56.410 --> 00:18:57.660
NO!

00:19:01.040 --> 00:19:03.660
You can't!

00:19:04.580 --> 00:19:08.830
What a loyal dog. We've got to give it our all too.

00:19:09.040 --> 00:19:10.040
Please, stop, Ayaka-san!

00:19:14.080 --> 00:19:16.290
Stop this game already!

00:19:17.330 --> 00:19:19.290
You can't stop a duel halfway.

00:19:19.950 --> 00:19:24.250
Once an SCM duel starts,
you cannot stop halfway through.

00:19:24.830 --> 00:19:26.910
It must continue until someone wins.

00:19:29.000 --> 00:19:33.200
I'll do it... I'll do as you say...

00:19:33.200 --> 00:19:35.950
So please, put an end to this!

00:19:36.200 --> 00:19:38.330
I thought you were smart!

00:19:38.450 --> 00:19:43.540
Don't do something like this to Ayaka-san or Zushi!

00:19:45.370 --> 00:19:47.410
Ayaka! Don't stop eating!

00:19:49.160 --> 00:19:56.160
I see. Eia, you're trying to make us feel guilty
and lose the game, isn't that right?

00:19:56.370 --> 00:19:58.160
No, that's not...

00:19:58.160 --> 00:20:01.790
True, that would be the only way to get me
to put an end this duel.

00:20:02.870 --> 00:20:04.910
Good thinking, Eia.

00:20:04.910 --> 00:20:07.290
I would expect nothing less of my chosen partner.

00:20:07.830 --> 00:20:10.160
Yuuga... you're...

00:20:13.580 --> 00:20:14.370
I...

00:20:14.370 --> 00:20:15.790
I ate it all!

00:20:35.410 --> 00:20:39.700
Now Zushiohmaru is transferred from his master, Ayaka,
to her master, myself.

00:20:42.160 --> 00:20:47.040
I'm sorry, Eia, but I just haven't seen
enough excitement yet.

00:20:47.870 --> 00:20:52.160
Ryuuou has five- no, probably have more than that.

00:20:53.040 --> 00:20:55.370
I'm going to get more than that.

00:20:56.000 --> 00:20:59.160
I know I can. I know WE can.

00:21:00.160 --> 00:21:02.250
You're fucking crazy.

00:21:02.870 --> 00:21:04.410
Oh, that's right.

00:21:04.410 --> 00:21:08.330
I forgot to mention it earlier,
but I'm not actually the "crazy person".

00:21:09.830 --> 00:21:16.870
I'M A CRAZY PERSON.
I AM MADLY IN LOVE WITH A HOPELESS MAN.
I WROTE THIS LETTER TO YOU TO ASK YOU A FAVOR.
I HAVE THREE SLAVES...

00:21:10.200 --> 00:21:13.950
That letter is real. I didn't write it.

00:21:14.370 --> 00:21:16.750
There's another "crazy person" out there.

00:21:18.540 --> 00:21:23.330
I just borrowed the name to make this plan work.

00:21:23.700 --> 00:21:27.370
It gave us a good opportunity
to strengthen our relationship.

00:21:27.750 --> 00:21:34.370
With Ryuuou and this "crazy person" now,
this SCM battle is about to get a lot more intense.

00:21:35.830 --> 00:21:38.370
No normal guy would be able to survive it.

00:21:39.250 --> 00:21:41.250
Don't worry...

00:21:41.750 --> 00:21:44.120
You're definitely not normal.

00:21:51.500 --> 00:21:54.870
Thank you. That's the nicest thing
you could've said to me.

00:21:56.080 --> 00:21:59.160
I can shine the brightest with you before me.

00:22:00.080 --> 00:22:02.290
I love you, Eia.

00:22:18.370 --> 00:22:22.000
-bewilderment-

00:22:23.910 --> 00:22:28.660
The ultimate game is testing my heart

00:22:28.660 --> 00:22:33.450
A strategy that starts from a one-on-one

00:22:33.450 --> 00:22:36.120
It's getting close, do I attack or pull back

00:22:36.120 --> 00:22:37.910
Play defense or offense on the brink?

00:22:37.910 --> 00:22:41.040
Tell me, which is better?

00:22:41.040 --> 00:22:45.290
I don't care if the rules leave me without a chance

00:22:45.290 --> 00:22:51.500
I have one last chance in my hand for my unclear future

00:22:51.500 --> 00:22:56.660
Does the deck in front of me shine light on that future?

00:22:57.330 --> 00:23:06.250
Examining your visible and hidden expression, my fate concealed

00:23:06.250 --> 00:23:11.410
Drawing forth luck, I don't want to lose

00:23:11.410 --> 00:23:15.160
I can't evolve if I keep saying "I can't"

00:23:15.160 --> 00:23:19.790
I'll win my game with you

00:23:19.910 --> 00:23:27.620
And overcome all barriers, so I never go bust again

00:23:37.410 --> 00:23:42.410
-awareness-
